<item>
  <title>Kizomba A Tension Leg Platform</title>
  <link>https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/kizomba-tension-leg-platform</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/kizomba-tension-leg-platform" hreflang="en"&gt;Kizomba A Tension Leg Platform&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;div class="field field--name-field-project-metrics field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;35,000 tonnes &lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;platform with 36 well slots&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;100-pax&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;living quarters design&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
  


  &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-highlights field--type-text-long field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Highlights&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;The platform design consisted of a 100-man living quarters, two 6,000 tonnes topsides modules, a 7,500 tonnes drilling rig, and two support modules.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;The facilities included two extensive production manifolds and associated utility, power and safety systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Design included the hull, foundation piles and tendons system.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-project-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The platform was designed to receive crude and associated gases, and produce 260 MMSCFD of gas and 250,000 BPD of liquids that were exported to a FPSO for treatment, storage and off-take by a shuttle tanker. The overall platform weighs 35,000 tonnes and has 36 well slots.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-solutions-category field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Fixed &amp;amp; Central Processing Platforms&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-spotlight-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;  &lt;img loading="eager" src="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/sites/default/files/styles/webp/public/2024-10/Kizomba.png.webp?itok=sfn6yr9e" width="864" height="576" alt="Fixed Platforms Kizomba" class="image-style-webp"&gt;


&lt;/div&gt;
      
  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-location field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Location&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;Off the Coast of Angola&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-scope field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Scope&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;EPIF, Expediting, Completions &amp;amp; Commissioning&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
</description>
